<title>UK: FORECAST-Survey on dlr levels after Congress race.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Survey on dlr levels after Congress race.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>If President Bill Clinton's Democrats make gains in the race to control the U.S. Congress, the dollar and Treasuries are expected to ease slightly in the short term, a Reuters survey of economists showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Following are full details of the survey based on this scenario:</p>
<p>				 Dlr/mark  Dlr/yen  30-yr T-bond yield</p>
<p> Mean of forecasts	 1.5043   112.98    6.73</p>
